      "why": "The fetch call on line 4 has no signal or timeout option, so a gateway call can wait without a limit. The comment on line 1 says 5 s, but no timer is set anywhere in the file, so the catch on lines 10-12 never sees a timeout. The 5 second timeout is not built.",
