      "id": "DEC-01",
      "path": "src/gateway.js",
      "line": 4,
      "why": "The fetch call on line 4 has no signal or timeout option (lines 4-7 pass only method and body), so a slow gateway is never cut off at 5 s and the call can hang without resolving to PENDING. Only a thrown error or a non-OK response reaches PENDING.",
      "verdict": "not_built"
     },
     {
      "id": "DEC-02",
      "path": "src/refund-service.js",
      "line": 13,
      "why": "Line 13 returns the stored result when the order ID is already in the store, so a repeated refund is not sent again. A store that throws on line 13 stops the call before postRefund on line 16.",
      "verdict": "built"
     }
    ]
